    not_duplicate_of: []  # edf0
    pr_ref:  # edf0
    description: "haproxy bakeoff: 2.4K orphan C/C++ symbols (29% orphan rate). Root cause: function pointer calls (callback patterns, dispatch tables) and macro-expanded function calls are not resolved by the tree-sitter C/C++ analyzer. Common patterns: (1) struct with function pointer fields called via ptr->callback(), (2) macro-generated function definitions (HAProxy uses extensive macro patterns), (3) callback registration (register_handler(name, func_ptr)). Fixing requires: (1) tracking function pointer assignments to struct fields, (2) expanding simple macro patterns to resolve generated names, (3) detecting callback registration patterns. Cross-ref: WI-fukik (investigation)."  # edf0
    fields: {}  # edf0
- op: discuss  # 89c4
